[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12062.71, "timestamp": "03:21:02", "text": "我们为人工智能和L相关的东西想出的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12063.75, "timestamp": "03:21:03", "text": "试图发表声明或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12065.59, "timestamp": "03:21:05", "text": "为了维持现状，什么都鼓励。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12067.67, "timestamp": "03:21:07", "text": "有条理，不能忘记我是个实验室工作人员，而且我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12070.71, "timestamp": "03:21:10", "text": "请勿转发他人作品，仅供参考。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12072.79, "timestamp": "03:21:12", "text": "我一直在寻找原创艺术家"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12074.95, "timestamp": "03:21:14", "text": "在直播中使用任何艺术作品之前，请先链接"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12077.75, "timestamp": "03:21:17", "text": "是的，是的，我想，我希望跟随"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12080.87, "timestamp": "03:21:20", "text": "和艾米莉亚·沃森的做法一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12082.79, "timestamp": "03:21:22", "text": "只是想整理一下东西，如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12085.03, "timestamp": "03:21:25", "text": "人们就像把它发布到推特上一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12089.19, "timestamp": "03:21:29", "text": "任何地方都可以，对吧？就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12090.95, "timestamp": "03:21:30", "text": "嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12094.15, "timestamp": "03:21:34", "text": "因为即使我不做，也会有……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12097.51, "timestamp": "03:21:37", "text": "将会从事这项工作的人。嗯，还有我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12099.75, "timestamp": "03:21:39", "text": "不想让它落入待办事项清单。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12103.51, "timestamp": "03:21:43", "text": "标签。所以我在这方面必须小心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12105.19, "timestamp": "03:21:45", "text": "观点。我真的很想做出……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12107.51, "timestamp": "03:21:47", "text": "指导方针，兄弟。我的天啊。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12110.15, "timestamp": "03:21:50", "text": "真的，真的，真的想做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12112.309, "timestamp": "03:21:52", "text": "衍生品指南。我知道我有一个"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 12113.218, "timestamp": "03:21:53", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "yeah that's very true"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12115.349, "timestamp": "03:21:55", "text": "衍生品指南，但我只需要"}]